        },
        {
          "text": " Konye apotu kojaut inabin lukeŋalak kotoma otuŋa, kwape ejauniata ikesisianakinak lukeŋalak kotomakus, luitolomunete kaiyeiyea apaar naemudiari, ido koŋerito Lokapolon loagweli kes, iriunete bonik amudiar nakatipet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
